# Local-only living state snapshot — the dev / maintainer view
# (implemented, active, planned, deferred). CHANGELOG.md is the
# user-facing "what's new". PROJECT_STATE.md is the internal
# inventory; both are maintained per PR.
PROJECT_STATE.md

# uma-race-extract local state. The config can hold an upload token,
# and captures/ is whatever races the maintainer happened to record —
# corpus samples worth keeping live in docs/room-match-scout/captures/.
